7016B931 WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 166] = [@0x7016B013:0, "    Albion the giant is feared throughout the land. No\x0A    known arcane or physical harm can befall him. He can\x0A    only be defeated if the attacker holds a shard of\x0A"]
7016B93A WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xBB4), 212] = [@bp(ac3, 0x4E8), 212]
7016B940 WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 180] = [@0x7016AFB9:0, "    the crystal of Albion. The crystal was destroyed many\x0A    eons ago, but fragments remain on the island of Isenmark\x0A    located somewhere in the ocean north of Dragonia. Albion\x0A"]
7016B949 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xD3C), 0x188] = [@bp(ac3, 0xBB4), 0x188]
7016B94F WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 175] = [@0x7016AF61:0, "    is immortal and posesses the ability to teleport to his\x0A    fortress (located in East Sarell) when his will so\x0A    dictates. Only after you have defeated Albion in battle\x0A"]
7016B958 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xF74), 0x237] = [@bp(ac3, 0xD3C), 0x237]
7016B95E WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 162] = [@0x7016AF0F:0, "    is access granted to his fortress. Once in the fortress an\x0A    alliance can be made with him.\x0A\x0AYour next quest is\x0Ato form an alliance with Albion the giant.\x0A\x0A"]
7016B969 WCMV emitted -	[@wp(ac3, 2344), 729 varying] = [@bp(ac3, 3956), 729]
7016B9A4 WCMV emitted -	[@wp(ac3, 628), 217 varying] = [@0x7016AEA1:0, "The evil lord Loric, known as Loric the Dark Lord,\x0Ahas been causing terror throughout the land. Your\x0Anext quest is to defeat Loric in battle and curtail\x0Ahis reign of terror, until, of course, his next\x0Areincarnation.\x0A\x0A"]
7016B9D0 WCMV emitted -	[@wp(ac3, 628), 240 varying] = [@0x7016AE29:0, "For your next quest you must form an alliance with Terrak the\x0AWizard and take over a Citadel. The citadel is a great\x0Afortified castle with inner and outer defences. Your charisma\x0Aas well as Terrak's magic is needed to complete this quest.\x0A\x0A"]
7016B9FA WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xBB4), 175] = [@0x7016ADD1:0, "Eons ago, a great horde of White Dragons terrorized the\x0Aterritory of Dragonia. They possessed mystical powers and\x0Awere feared by all. Sir Leonard the Bold was given the quest\x0A"]
7016BA00 WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 178] = [@0x7016AD77:0, "to rid the land of the White Dragons. He wisely sought out\x0Athe great and powerful wizard (what else can wizards be?)\x0ATerrak who fashioned a charmed sword dubbed \x22Dragon Slayer.\x0A\x22"]
7016BA09 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xD3C), 0x161] = [@bp(ac3, 0xBB4), 0x161]
7016BA0F WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 179] = [@0x7016AD1D:0, "Terrak commanded Sir Leonard to cast \x22Dragon Slayer\x22 deep into\x0Athe bowels of the earth upon fulfillment of the quest. The\x0Abrave knight slayed all known White Dragons and kept his\x0A"]
7016BA18 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xF74), 0x214] = [@bp(ac3, 0xD3C), 0x214]
7016BA1E WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 152] = [@0x7016ACD1:0, "commitment to the wizard. Unbeknownst to him, one White\x0ADragon survived. Your quest is to retrieve \x22Dragon Slayer\x22\x0Aand finish the task of Sir Leonard.\x0A\x0A"]
7016BA29 WCMV emitted -	[@wp(ac3, 2344), 684 varying] = [@bp(ac3, 3956), 684]
7016BA53 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xA64), 160] = [@0x7016AC81:0, "A great voice thunders from the heavens:\x0A\x0A\x22The heathen prince Bristle the Banisher has stolen from\x0Amy most holy temple the Silver Chalice.  This pagan has been\x0A"]
7016BA59 WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 175] = [@0x7016AC29:0, "desecrating the holy symbol by employing it in his profane\x0Aand orgiastic rituals.  Your next quest, my child, is to\x0Asearch out the Banisher, defeat him in battle, and recover\x0A"]
7016BA62 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0xD3C), 0x14F] = [@bp(ac3, 0xA64), 0x14F]
7016BA68 WCMV emitted -	[@ac2, 135] = [@0x7016ABE5:0, "the symbol.  Upon possession, it will guide you back to its\x0Arightful place on the altar of the temple by the Light of\x0ARighteousness.\x22\x0A\x0A"]
