7016DDA6 WCMV emitted -	[@bp(ac3, 0x150), 182] = [@0x7016C085:0, "\x14Food\x15\x0A\x0A    Food rations can be purchased at stores.  They last for\x0Aabout seven days, a day being approx. 60 moves.  Food is\x0Aautomatically consumed from either you inventory or from\x0A"]
